### Login 
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marti@test.com",
  "contrasena": "12345678"
}

### Crear vehículo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "modelo": "Actros 2041",
  "patente": "AB123CD",
  "anio": 2020,
  "capacidad_carga": 18000
}

### Listar vehículos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Listar filtrando por marca
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos?marca=mercedes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Obtener vehículo por id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Actualizar vehículo
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "modelo": "Actros 2045",
  "patente": "AB123CD",
  "anio": 2021,
  "capacidad_carga": 20000
}

### Eliminar vehículo
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Error 400: datos inválidos
POST http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "marca": "",
  "modelo": "Actros",
  "patente": "123",
  "anio": 1800,
  "capacidad_carga": -5
}

### Error 404: id inexistente
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Error 401: sin token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos